{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50095","headline":"海阳湖 · 无名氏","name":"海阳湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾涨海阳泉，以爲海阳湖。\n千峯在水中，状类皆自殊。\n有如三神山，苍苍海上孤。\n又似洲岛中，忽然见龙鱼。\n引船过石间，随兴得所如。\n每有惬心处，沈吟复踌躇。\n吾恐天地间，怪异如此无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}